  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Artisan made takes on a new meaning. The whirling wood grains and rich shades of each sleek, minimalist&nbsp;<a target=\"_blank\" title=\"Wood Phone Cases\" href=\"https://kerfcase.com/collections/wood-phone-cases\" rel=\"noopener\">wood phone case</a>,&nbsp;<a target=\"_blank\" title=\"Wireless Chargers\" href=\"https://kerfcase.com/collections/wireless-chargers\" rel=\"noopener\">wireless charger</a>,&nbsp;<a target=\"_blank\" title=\"Card Wallet\" href=\"https://kerfcase.com/products/card-wallet\" rel=\"noopener\">wallet</a>, and&nbsp;<a target=\"_blank\" title=\"Studio Case\" href=\"https://kerfcase.com/products/studio-case\" rel=\"noopener\">pencil case</a> are as unique as the locally salvaged trees from which they are cut, shaped, and polished by hand in the hills of Southwestern Pennsylvania.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Each product is crafted by hand from locally sourced and sustainably harvested woods.&nbsp; We are dedicated to improving experiences through craftsmanship and improving the environment through better practices.&nbsp; We do this by cutting each item to order, which means when you buy a case from us, we make it specifically for you.&nbsp; Every piece is wholly unique and one-of-a-kind, so anyone can express themselves sustainably through the natural beauty of hardwood.</p>",
